      "text": "### The Thesis"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-SCIENCE-RELIGION.md#007",
      "path": [
        "07-SCIENCE-RELIGION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:religious-studies:07-science-religion, git-history:religious-studies:07-science-religion]",
        "canonical_path": "religious-studies/07-SCIENCE-RELIGION.md",
        "concepts": "[science, religion]",
        "current_path": "religious-studies/07-SCIENCE-RELIGION.md",
        "id": "maxim:religious-studies:science-religion",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "religious-studies",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[science, religion]",
        "section": "religious-studies",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Science and Religion",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "John William Draper's \"History of the Conflict Between Religion and Science\" (1874)\nand Andrew Dickson White's \"A History of the Warfare of Science with Theology in\nChristendom\" (1896) created the \"conflict thesis\" as a historiographic narrative:\nreligion and science are inherently in conflict; science has progressively defeated\nreligion; the future belongs to science."
    },
    {
      "id": "07-SCIENCE-RELIGION.md#008",
      "path": [
        "07-SCIENCE-RELIGION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:religious-studies:07-science-religion, git-history:religious-studies:07-science-religion]",
        "canonical_path": "religious-studies/07-SCIENCE-RELIGION.md",
        "concepts": "[science, religion]",
        "current_path": "religious-studies/07-SCIENCE-RELIGION.md",
        "id": "maxim:religious-studies:science-religion",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "religious-studies",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[science, religion]",
        "section": "religious-studies",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Science and Religion",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "This thesis was enormously influential in public discourse. It is still the default\npopular narrative. And historians of science reject it."
    },
    {
      "id": "07-SCIENCE-RELIGION.md#009",
      "path": [
        "07-SCIENCE-RELIGION.md"
      ],
